<strong>08h00<\/strong> no Largo 1\u00ba de Maio em <strong>Penha Garcia<\/strong>, Idanha-a-Nova.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e desn\u00edveis do evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa integra o Trail 33 km (1400m D+), o Sprint 21 km (750m D+), o Mini 14 km (400m D+) e a Caminhada de 9 km (300m D+).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">A prova inclui almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio e banhos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, todas as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es incluem abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, seguro desportivo, banhos quentes e o tradicional almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio beir\u00e3o ap\u00f3s a prova.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">At\u00e9 quando decorrem as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es est\u00e3o abertas na plataforma OMDC Eventos at\u00e9 ao dia <strong>11 de Outubro de 2026<\/strong> ou at\u00e9 ser atingido o limite de vagas por dist\u00e2ncia.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem online na plataforma <a href=\"https:\/\/www.omdceventos.com\/evento\/tta-trail-por-terras-do-adufe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">OMDC Eventos<\/a>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail por Terras do Adufe 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-17\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Largo 1\u00ba de Maio, Penha Garcia\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Idanha-a-Nova\", \"addressRegion\": \"Castelo Branco\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"N\u00facleo do SCP de Penha Garcia e TrailsUP\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Trail por Terras do Adufe 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 17 de Outubro de 2026 , com partidas a partir das 08h00 no Largo 1\u00ba de Maio em Penha Garcia , Idanha-a-Nova.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e desn\u00edveis do evento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O programa integra o Trail 33 km (1400m D+), o Sprint 21 km (750m D+), o Mini 14 km (400m D+) e a Caminhada de 9 km (300m D+).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"A prova inclui almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio e banhos?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, todas as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es incluem abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, seguro desportivo, banhos quentes e o tradicional almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio beir\u00e3o ap\u00f3s a prova.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"At\u00e9 quando decorrem as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es est\u00e3o abertas na plataforma OMDC Eventos at\u00e9 ao dia 11 de Outubro de 2026 ou at\u00e9 ser atingido o limite de vagas por dist\u00e2ncia.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem online na plataforma OMDC Eventos .\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66250,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[535,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-51236","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-penha-garcia-idanha-a-nova","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-castelo-branco","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/trail-por-terras-do-adufe-2026-1024x1002.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http